  "steps": [
    "Heat the oil in a large pot and brown the beef and sausage, breaking it into small pieces.",
    "Push the meat aside, add the onion and let it soften and caramelize for a few minutes, then stir it together.",
    "Add the garlic, Italian seasoning, red pepper flakes, salt and pepper, then the tomato paste, and cook until the paste turns deep red.",
    "Pour in the marinara, stock and basil, scraping up any browned bits from the bottom of the pot.",
    "Break the lasagna noodles into quarters and add them, then simmer about 20 minutes until tender.",
    "Turn off the heat and stir in the cream, mozzarella and parmesan.",
    "Mix the ricotta with the shredded mozzarella and herbs, and top each bowl with a scoop."
  ],
